<title>UKRAINE: Swedish company wins Ukraine oxygen firm tender.</title>
<headline>Swedish company wins Ukraine oxygen firm tender.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish company AGA AB has won a strategic investment tender to purchase 31.2 percent of shares in oxygen producer AT Dniprokysen, the State Property Fund said on Friday.</p>
<p>AGA beat a Russian and a U.S. company in the tender, which obliges the winner to invest $3.1 million in the next three years to upgrade its factory in the eastern Ukrainian city of Dnipropetrovsk.</p>
<p>Dniprokysen's nominal capital is valued at about the equivalent of $368,000.</p>
<p>--Natalya Zinets, Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
